# A non-linear many-body potential for the multi-rank tests
# (tests/mpi/check_pair_tadah_mpi.py): the descriptors of the Quick Start
# potential (D2_Blip + DM_mBlipEnv) with MODEL M_BLR BF_Polynomial2, written by
# `tadah train` (1.6.0) from Tadah.MLIP's docs/source/quickstart/config.train
# with its MODEL and LAMBDA lines replaced by `MODEL M_BLR BF_Polynomial2` and
# `LAMBDA 1e-6`, on that directory's db.train. pair_style tadah evaluates a
# non-linear model with the full-list kernel (compute_2b_mb_full, newton on).
# The lines of the keys EWEIGHT, FWEIGHT, SWEIGHT and WDBFILE_AUTO, which
# Tadah! 1.6.0 retired and no load of a potential reads, are left out.
